  "description": "The concept that landmines are triggered by weight or pressure is a real-world engineering principle. This knowledge is necessary to interpret the meme's joke — the idea that someone is 'too light' to activate a landmine — as a literal, physical impossibility, which forms the basis of the dark humor.",
